{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51657","headline":"造寺保民 · 钱鏐","name":"造寺保民","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"百谷收成届应锺，南方景象喜重重。\n三秋甘泽烟尘息，四序和风气色浓。\n播种勤耕盈廪庾，兆民兴让洽温恭。\n广崇至道尊三教，盖爲生灵奉圣容。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱鏐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51657.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51657","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}